{"text":"正光六年歲次乙巳，朔五月十五日，像主蘇胡仁合邑十九人等造釋加一區，仰爲皇帝陛下、諸邑子等。復願七世父母、所生父母、因緣眷屬，一時成佛。像主蘇胡仁；邑子劉老。邑老劉羅察；邑子劉歡伯。邑老□阿曜；邑子蘭噉鬼。邑老朱定生；邑子王阿明。邑子臧桃松；邑子張苟仁。邑子秦寬奴；邑子載歡欣。邑子蘇羅得；邑子劉貴洛。邑子郭阿興；邑子樂魏保。邑子郭白虎；邑子劉阿肆郎。□□□□□；邑子蘇神□。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"蘇胡仁","refId":null,"text":"蘇胡仁","start":18,"end":21},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋加","start":28,"end":30},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":57,"end":59},{"name":"PersonName","term":"蘇胡仁","refId":null,"text":"蘇胡仁","start":69,"end":72},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":73,"end":75},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉老","refId":null,"text":"劉老","start":75,"end":77},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑老","refId":null,"text":"邑老","start":78,"end":80},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉羅察","refId":null,"text":"劉羅察","start":80,"end":83},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":84,"end":86},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉歡伯","refId":null,"text":"劉歡伯","start":86,"end":89},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑老","refId":null,"text":"邑老","start":90,"end":92},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":96,"end":98},{"name":"PersonName","term":"蘭噉鬼","refId":null,"text":"蘭噉鬼","start":98,"end":101},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑老","refId":null,"text":"邑老","start":102,"end":104},{"name":"PersonName","term":"朱定生","refId":null,"text":"朱定生","start":104,"end":107},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":108,"end":110},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王阿明","refId":null,"text":"王阿明","start":110,"end":113},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":114,"end":116},{"name":"PersonName","term":"臧桃松","refId":null,"text":"臧桃松","start":116,"end":119},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":120,"end":122},{"name":